        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Enkibelekenyata e Asa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eewuo apa enkiyang'et o Laitoriani shumata Asaria olayioni le Oded, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neipang ninye alo anang'are Asa. Nejoki ninye, “Toning'oki nanu Asa, o Yuda pooki o Benchamen: Etii Olaitoriani tenebo iyie, eton sii iyie itii tenebo ninye. Tening'oru iyie ninye nitum, kake tening'ua iyie ninye niking'uaa sii ninye iyie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore te nkata naado nemeeta Israel Enkai nasipa. Nemeeta olapolosani oiteng'enisho, nemeeta enkitanapata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake teneibelekenyakino ninche to sina lenye Olaitoriani, Enkai e Israel, neing'oru ninye nenoto ninche ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore apa te nena katitin nemeetae eseriani teilo oipang o teilo ojing'u amu etijing'aka enyamali sapuk lelo oomanya nkuapi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eitaaki ninche ngiligilat. Negilunore olosho olosho, negilunore enkanasa enkanasa, amu eitanyamala Enkai ninche te pooki pukunoto o sina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake ntagoluoyu iyie! Mincho elepori nkaik inono, amu eikilaakini esiaai ino.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ake pee ening Asa kulo rorei, ina aibon e Asaria olayioni le Aded, neitagoluo, neiwuang'ie nena kitanyaanyukot oo nkaitin naa ninche olminong teina kop e Yuda o ene Benchamen, o te nena anas naawa ninye teina kop oo ldoinyio e Efraim. Neitoki ninye aitobir olperere lo lasar lo Laitoriani apa otii dukuya olgoriet le nkaji o Laitoriani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neiturrur ninye Yuda pooki o Benchamen, o lelo ooing'uaa Efraim, o Manase o Simion apa oobikito tenebo ninche, amu iltung'ana kumok ooisikakita ninye eing'ua Israel, ina kata pee edol aajo etii Olaitoriani Enkai enye tenebo ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eiturrurrote apa ninche te Yerusalem to lapa liokuni lo lari le tomon o imiet le nkitoria e Asa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nepolosaki ninche Olaitoriani olasar teina olong, te nena masaa apa naataarutua ninche ilmong'i iip naapishana, o nkerra nkalifuni naapishana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neibung ninche olning'o lo sotua pee eing'oru Olaitoriani, Enkai oo loo menye, too ltauja lenye pooki o te nkishui enye pooki; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naa ore pooki ng'ae lemeing'oru Olaitoriani Enkai e Israel, neari metua, aa oti o aa moruo, aa olee anaa enkitok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Einosie ninche Olaitoriani olmumai to ltoilo sapuk, o te mbuakunoto o too ntarumpetani, o te oshoto oo mowuarak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neshipa Yuda pooki tenkaraki ilo mumai; amu einosa ninche too ltauja lenye pooki, neing'orutua ninche ninye te yieunoto enye pooki, nenoto ninche ninye, neishoo Olaitoriani ninche enkiyeng'iyeng too nkaloli pooki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore doi ninye Maaka, ng'otonye, eiwuang'ie olaiguanani Asa pee meitoki aata enkitoo enye enkaraki nataasa embae olminong, aitobir enkitanyaanyukoto e Ashera. Nedung Asa ina kitanyaanyukoto auroo, neidong aitaa irrarrat, nelo apejoo to erata le Kidron. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake eitu apa eiwuang'ieki iwuejitin neeika e Israel. Ore ake etiu neijia nemeeta apa oltau le Asa eleyiata too nkolong'i e nkishui enye pooki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyau ninye atua enkaji e Nkai nena tokitin apa naaitisinya menye o nkishorot naaitisinya ninye makewan, enkosholai o sahabu o masaa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neitu aikata eitokini aata olarrabal o metabau olari le tomoni uni o imiet le nkitoria e Asa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
